### CoachFrame API — REST Client (VS Code)
### Installa l'estensione "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) per usare questo file

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### Dopo il login, copia il token qui:
@token = INCOLLA_IL_TOKEN_QUI
@trainerToken = INCOLLA_IL_TOKEN_TRAINER_QUI

### ID da aggiornare in base al DB
@equipmentId = 1
@exerciseId = 1
@programId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@sessionExerciseId = 1
@clientId = 3
@assignmentId = 1

# =============================================================
# AUTH
# =============================================================

### Registrazione
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "surname": "Utente",
  "email": "test@coachframe.it",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@coachframe.it",
  "password": "User123!"
}

###

### Login trainer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "melissa@coachframe.it",
  "password": "User123!"
}

###

### Login admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@coachframe.it",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Forgot password
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@coachframe.it"
}

###

### Reset password (usa il token ricevuto via email)
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN_DA_EMAIL",
  "password": "NuovaPassword1!"
}

# =============================================================
# UTENTI
# =============================================================

### Profilo utente corrente
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Aggiorna profilo
PUT {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marco",
  "surname": "Bianchi"
}

# =============================================================
# ATTREZZATURA
# =============================================================

### Lista attrezzatura disponibile
GET {{base}}/equipment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Attrezzatura posseduta dall'utente
GET {{base}}/equipment/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Aggiungi attrezzo
POST {{base}}/equipment/mine/{{equipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Rimuovi attrezzo
DELETE {{base}}/equipment/mine/{{equipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# =============================================================
# ESERCIZI
# =============================================================

### Lista tutti gli esercizi
GET {{base}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Filtra per gruppo muscolare
GET {{base}}/exercises?muscle_group=gambe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Filtra per difficoltà
GET {{base}}/exercises?difficulty=principiante
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Filtra per attrezzatura posseduta
GET {{base}}/exercises?my_equipment=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dettaglio esercizio
GET {{base}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Regole angolari effettive per l'utente (override trainer o default) — RF-AI1
GET {{base}}/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crea esercizio (trainer/admin)
POST {{base}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Squat bulgaro",
  "description": "Variante avanzata dello squat.",
  "muscle_group": "gambe",
  "difficulty": "avanzato",
  "angle_rules": [
    { "joint": "knee", "min": 70, "max": 175, "phase": "down", "side": "both" }
  ]
}

# =============================================================
# SCHEDE / PROGRAMMI
# =============================================================

### Lista schede
GET {{base}}/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Lista schede filtrate per attrezzatura
GET {{base}}/programs?filterByEquipment=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dettaglio scheda
GET {{base}}/programs/{{programId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Crea scheda
POST {{base}}/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Full Body Custom",
  "description": "Scheda personalizzata",
  "difficulty": "intermedio",
  "duration_weeks": 8,
  "sessions_per_week": 3
}

# =============================================================
# SESSIONI
# =============================================================

### Avvia sessione
POST {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "program_id": 1
}

###

### Avvia sessione libera (senza scheda)
POST {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Chiudi sessione
PATCH {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Storico sessioni
GET {{base}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Statistiche aggregate
GET {{base}}/sessions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dettaglio sessione
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Log esercizio in sessione
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exercise_id": {{exerciseId}},
  "sets_done": 3,
  "reps_done": 10,
  "form_score": 85
}

###

### Salva dati di una serie con angoli MediaPipe — RF-AI2
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/exercises/{{sessionExerciseId}}/sets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "set_number": 1,
  "reps_done": 10,
  "angle_data": {
    "knee_min": 95,
    "knee_avg": 108,
    "failures": [{ "rep": 3, "angle": 115 }]
  },
  "form_score": 82
}

###

### Dettaglio serie (visibile al trainer) — RF-AI2
GET {{base}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/exercises/{{sessionExerciseId}}/sets
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Trend storico di un esercizio
GET {{base}}/sessions/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# =============================================================
# TRAINER
# =============================================================

### Overview clienti
GET {{base}}/trainer/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Lista clienti
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Aggiungi cliente per email
POST {{base}}/trainer/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@coachframe.it"
}

###

### Rimuovi cliente
DELETE {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Stats di un cliente
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Sessioni di un cliente
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Progressi dettagliati di un cliente
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Schede assegnate a un cliente
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Assegna scheda a un cliente
POST {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/assign/{{programId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Rimuovi assegnazione scheda
DELETE {{base}}/trainer/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

# =============================================================
# REGOLE ANGOLARI PERSONALIZZATE — RF-AI1
# =============================================================

### Lista regole del trainer per un cliente
GET {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

###

### Crea o aggiorna regola per cliente+esercizio
PUT {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/rules/{{exerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rules": [
    { "joint": "knee", "min": 100, "max": 175, "phase": "down", "side": "both" }
  ]
}

###

### Elimina regola personalizzata
DELETE {{base}}/trainer/clients/{{clientId}}/rules/{{exerciseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
